OL,3,ATwo men arrested after boy injured in
OL,4,Asword attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested after a
OL,7,Fteenager was injured in an attack
OL,8,Finvolving a sword near two schools in
OL,9,FGloucester.
OL,11,FSt Peter's High School and Willow
OL,12,FPrimary Academy, in Tuffley, were put
OL,13,Finto lockdown after the incident at
OL,14,F08:50 GMT on Friday. Armed police
OL,15,Fattended the scene to search for the
OL,16,Fsuspects who reportedly fled on foot.
OL,18,FPolice said a 17-year-old suffered a
OL,19,Fwound "believed to have been caused by
OL,20,Fthe sword".
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
